---
<Layout title="3D Renderings Service | ATECT Architecture" description="ATECT Architecture 3D rendering services for residential and commercial projects, including interior renderings, exterior renderings, 360 panoramas and architectural animations.">
<section class="page-hero"><div class="eyebrow">3D Renderings Service</div><h1>Bring Your Design to Life</h1><p>3D renderings are a great way to visualize your residential or commercial project. Our renderings will visually help bring your ideas to life.</p></section>

<section class="section portfolio-section"><div class="section-heading"><div class="eyebrow">Exterior Visualization</div><h2>Exterior Renderings</h2><p>Exterior renderings provide a realistic view of proposed homes, additions and commercial projects, helping clients visualize the finished design.</p></div>
<div class="render-slider" data-slider="exterior"><div class="slides">{exteriorRenderings.map((image,i)=><img class:list={{active:i===0}} src={image} alt={`Exterior rendering ${i+1}`} loading={i===0?"eager":"lazy"}/>)}</div><button class="arrow prev" type="button" data-prev aria-label="Previous exterior rendering">‹</button><button class="arrow next" type="button" data-next aria-label="Next exterior rendering">›</button><div class="bar"><button class="fullscreen" type="button" data-fullscreen>View Fullscreen</button><span data-counter>1 / {exteriorRenderings.length}</span></div></div>
<div class="thumbs">{exteriorRenderings.map((image,i)=><button type="button" class:list={{active:i===0}} data-thumb={i} aria-label={`Show exterior rendering ${i+1}`}><img src={image} alt="" loading="lazy"/></button>)}</div></section>

<section class="section alt portfolio-section"><div class="section-heading centered"><div class="eyebrow">Visualization</div><h2>Interior Renderings</h2><p>Explore interior visualization work that shows how materials, finishes, lighting and architectural spaces can come together before construction.</p></div>
<div class="render-slider" data-slider="interior"><div class="slides">{interiorRenderings.map((item,i)=><img class:list={{active:i===0}} src={item.image} alt={item.title} loading={i===0?"eager":"lazy"}/>)}</div><button class="arrow prev" type="button" data-prev aria-label="Previous interior rendering">‹</button><button class="arrow next" type="button" data-next aria-label="Next interior rendering">›</button><div class="bar"><button class="fullscreen" type="button" data-fullscreen>View Fullscreen</button><span data-counter>1 / {interiorRenderings.length}</span></div></div>
<div class="thumbs">{interiorRenderings.map((item,i)=><button type="button" class:list={{active:i===0}} data-thumb={i} aria-label={`Show interior rendering ${i+1}`}><img src={item.image} alt="" loading="lazy"/></button>)}</div></section>

<section class="section alt2"><div class="section-heading centered"><div class="eyebrow">Immersive Visualization</div><h2>360 Panoramas</h2><p>Experience an immersive 360° view of the design directly on the ATECT Architecture website.</p></div><div class="panorama-embed"><iframe src="https://momento360.com/e/uc/572d67a7db124ef0a2919f7805e81f0c?utm_campaign=embed&amp;utm_source=other&amp;utm_medium=embed&amp;size=medium&amp;display-plan=true" title="ATECT Architecture 360 Panorama" loading="lazy" allowfullscreen="true" frameborder="0"></iframe></div></section>

<section class="section portfolio-section"><div class="section-heading"><div class="eyebrow">Motion Visualization</div><h2>Architectural Animations</h2><p>Architectural animations help communicate how a project looks and feels as the viewer moves through the design.</p></div><div class="animation-grid">{animationProjects.map(item=><article class="animation-card"><div class="animation-image">{item.title === "Roochvarg" ? <video controls preload="metadata" playsinline poster={item.image} aria-label="Roochvarg architectural animation"><source src="https://media.atectarchitecture.com/Roochvarg%20(1).mp4" type="video/mp4"/></video> : item.title === "Prairie View" ? <video controls preload="metadata" playsinline poster={item.image} aria-label="Prairie View architectural animation"><source src="https://media.atectarchitecture.com/Prairie%20View.mp4" type="video/mp4"/></video> : item.title === "LIW Indian Head Headquarters" ? <video controls preload="metadata" playsinline poster={item.image} aria-label="LIW Indian Head Headquarters architectural animation"><source src="https://media.atectarchitecture.com/LIW%20Indian%20Head%20Headquarters%20(1).mp4" type="video/mp4"/></video> : item.title === "NVA" ? <video controls preload="metadata" playsinline poster={item.image} aria-label="NVA architectural animation"><source src="https://media.atectarchitecture.com/NVA%20(2).mp4" type="video/mp4"/></video> : <><img src={item.image} alt={`${item.title} architectural animation`} loading="lazy"/><div class="play-badge">▶</div><span class="duration">{item.duration}</span></>}</div><div class="animation-copy"><h3>{item.title}</h3><p>Architectural animation</p></div></article>)}</div></section>

<section class="explore-projects"><div class="eyebrow">Explore More Projects</div><h2>See More of Our Work</h2><p>Explore ATECT Architecture's residential, commercial and custom home project work.</p><div class="explore-grid"><a href="/projects/residential"><span>Residential Projects</span><strong>View Residential Work →</strong></a><a href="/projects/commercial"><span>Commercial Projects</span><strong>View Commercial Work →</strong></a><a href="/projects/custom-homes"><span>Custom Home Plans</span><strong>Explore Custom Homes →</strong></a><a class="explore-all" href="/projects"><span>Portfolio</span><strong>View All Projects →</strong></a></div></section>
<section class="cta-section"><div class="eyebrow">Start a Conversation</div><h2>In need of rendering service?</h2><p>Contact ATECT Architecture today to discuss your residential or commercial visualization needs.</p><a class="button" href="/contact">Contact Us Today</a></section>
</Layout>
<script>
  document.querySelectorAll('[data-slider]').forEach((slider) => {
    const slides = Array.from(slider.querySelectorAll('.slides img'));
    const thumbs = Array.from(slider.parentElement.querySelectorAll('[data-thumb]'));
    const counter = slider.querySelector('[data-counter]');
    let current = 0;
    const show = (index) => {
      current = (index + slides.length) % slides.length;
      slides.forEach((slide, i) => slide.classList.toggle('active', i === current));
      thumbs.forEach((thumb, i) => thumb.classList.toggle('active', i === current));
      if (counter) counter.textContent = `${current + 1} / ${slides.length}`;
    };
    slider.querySelector('[data-prev]')?.addEventListener('click', () => show(current - 1));
    slider.querySelector('[data-next]')?.addEventListener('click', () => show(current + 1));
    thumbs.forEach((thumb, i) => thumb.addEventListener('click', () => show(i)));
    slider.querySelector('[data-fullscreen]')?.addEventListener('click', () => {
      if (document.fullscreenElement) document.exitFullscreen(); else if (slider.requestFullscreen) slider.requestFullscreen();
    });
    show(0);
    slider.setAttribute('tabindex', '0');
    slider.addEventListener('keydown', (event) => { if (event.key === 'ArrowLeft') show(current - 1); if (event.key === 'ArrowRight') show(current + 1); });
    let startX = 0;
    slider.addEventListener('touchstart', (event) => { startX = event.changedTouches[0].screenX; }, { passive: true });
    slider.addEventListener('touchend', (event) => { const distance = event.changedTouches[0].screenX - startX; if (Math.abs(distance) > 45) show(current + (distance < 0 ? 1 : -1)); }, { passive: true });
  });
</script>
